      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good overview. Could you expand a bit more on the specific enzymatic steps? I'm particularly interested in how the cell's internal defense mechanisms—the breakdown of the amino acid sulfoxides—happen so rapidly once the physical integrity of the cell is breached. It seems almost like an instantaneous, aggressive response.",
